ok:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Cream Cheese|cream cheese]], softened\n* 6 slices peeled [[cookbook:cucumber|cucumber]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Alfalfa|alfalfa sprouts]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Wine vinegar|red wine vinegar]]\n* 1 [[cookbook:tomato|tomato]], [[cookbook:slicing|sliced]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Lettuce|romaine (cos) lettuce]] leaf\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Pepperoncini|pepperoncini]], sliced\n* ½ [[cookbook:avocado|avocado]], peeled and mashed\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]] to taste\n* [[cookbook:pepper|Pepper]] to taste\n\n==Procedure==\n#Spread 1 tablespoon cream cheese on each slice of bread. \n#Arrange cucumber slices in a single layer on one slice of bread. \n#Cover same slice of bread with alfalfa sprouts, sprinkle with oil and vinegar. \n#Layer same slice of bread with tomato slices, lettuce, and pepperoncini. \n#Spread mashed avocado on other slice of bread.\n#Add salt and pepper to taste \n#Assemble sandwich and serve immediately.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for sandwiches|Cucumber Sprout Sandwich]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sprouts|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using avocado|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using alfalfa sprout]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lettuce]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Cucumber Sprout Sandwich","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 slices whole wheat bread","sourceText":"2 slices whole wheat bread","amountText":"2 slices whole wheat bread","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 tbsp cream cheese, softened","sourceText":"2 tbsp cream cheese, softened","amountText":"2 tbsp cream cheese, softened","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"6 slices peeled cucumber","sour